         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The FXL6408 is an 8-bit I2C-controlled GPIO expander. When configured in Input Mode, the FXL6408 monitors the input ports for data transitions and signals the baseband by asserting the INT pin.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
